 on the specific index and its corresponding regional exchange. For instance, US indices like the S&amp;P 500 and Dow Jones generally operate between 9:30 AM and 4:00 PM EST, whereas the UK's FTSE 100 is open from 8:00 AM to 4:30 PM GMT. Be sure to check your platform dashboard for detailed operational sessions.</p></div></details><details class="vr-faq-card"><summary>What moves prices of indices?</summary><div class="vr-faq-content"><p style="font-size:15px;margin:0">Index values fluctuate in response to the price movements of their constituent stocks. Key triggers include macroeconomic announcements, quarterly corporate earnings reports, central bank interest rate decisions, and general market sentiment. Broader geopolitical news and shifts in global trade policies also drive volatility in these indices.</p></div></details><details class="vr-faq-card"><summary>What are the major indices on Venture Asia?</summary><div class="vr-faq-content"><p style="font-size:15px;margin:0;margin-bottom:10px">The benchmark stock indices available on our platform include:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted)"><li><strong>Dow Jones Industrial Average (DJIA / US30)</strong>: Monitors 30 blue-chip U.S. corporations.</li><li><strong>S&amp;P 500 (SPX500)</strong>: Reflects 500 of the largest U.S. publicly traded firms.</li><li><strong>NASDAQ 100 (NAS100)</strong>: Concentrates on 100 leading non-financial technology and growth companies.</li><li><strong>FTSE 100 (UK100)</strong>: Measures the 100 largest companies listed on the London Stock Exchange.</li><li><strong>DAX (GER40)</strong>: Represents the top 40 major enterprises on the Frankfurt Stock Exchange.</li></ul></div></details><details class="vr-faq-card"><summary>How to trade indices?</summary><div class="vr-faq-content"><p style="font-size:15px;margin:0">To begin trading indices, open a live account on our platform. We offer indices as CFDs (Contracts for Difference). Select your chosen index (such as the SPX500 or NAS100), analyze its charts, and place a buy (long) or sell (short) order. Always employ risk management protocols like stop-loss levels to safeguard your balance.</p></div></details></div></div></section><template data-va-step-active="0"><div class="vr-glassbox" style="padding:16px 20px;cursor:pointer;z-index:1;background:rgba(46,123,255,0.06);border-color:var(--accent);transition:all 0.2s ease;margin-left:0px" data-va-step-btn="0"><div class="vr-flex vr-ac" style="gap:16px"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-2);color:#05101F;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace">1</div><div class="vr-flex vr-ac" style="justify-content:space-between;flex:1"><h4 style="font-size:17px;margin:0">Sign Up &amp; Verify</h4><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" style="transform:rotate(180deg);transition:transform 0.2s ease;opacity:0.7"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></div><div style="padding-left:48px;margin-top:10px"><p class="vr-muted" style="font-size:14.5px;margin:0;line-height:1.5">Create a live account and complete a quick KYC verification process.</p></div></div></template><template data-va-step-inactive="0"><div class="vr-glassbox" style="padding:16px 20px;cursor:pointer;z-index:1;background:rgba(8,26,48,0.3);border-color:var(--line);transition:all 0.2s ease;margin-left:0px" data-va-step-btn="0"><div class="vr-flex vr-ac" style="gap:16px"><div style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--panel-2);color:var(--text);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace">1</div><div class="vr-flex vr-ac" style="justify-content:space-between;flex:1"><h4 style="font-size:17px;margin:0">Sign Up &amp; Verify</h4><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width